<title>USA: GE Capital acquires LocaFrance Equipement.</title>
<headline>GE Capital acquires LocaFrance Equipement.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>GE Capital Services said it has completed the acquisition of LocaFrance Equipement SA from LocaFrance SA for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>The General Electric Co subsidiary said LocaFrance Equipement, together with Sovac Enterprises, positions GE Capital as one of the largest equipment financing operations in France, in addition to its other financial services activities. ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
